<BaseLayout title="Industry Predicts AI Will Surpass Top Experts in 3-4 Years: What Middle-Aged People Should See Clearly — BanbaiGuan AI" jsonLd={articleJsonLd} ogDescription="English summary for: Industry Predicts AI Will Surpass Top Experts in 3-4 Years: What Middle-Aged People Should See Clearly" navActive="banbaiguan" lang="en">
